                <pb facs="1044" n="894" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg894"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 2151/49.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Gummeré to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Tangier</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-08-24"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 24,
                    1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>States that proclamation of Mouley Hafid as Sultan of Morocco and his acceptance
                    have been officially confirmed; that the new Sultan has constituted his
                    government and has been accepted by all southern Morocco, including coast
                    towns.</p>
            </div>
